  {
   "id": "t_d52cff2e8a7be5a84c73",
   "sourceHash": "d52cff2e8a7be5a84c73439747fc93177f267f23c5884c74b622d0d8c232036b",
   "text": "当アーユルヴェーダ療養施設での治療",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Health Retreat' rendered as 療養施設 (clinical register)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e7ee9889708647aa5a2d",
   "sourceHash": "e7ee9889708647aa5a2da1e91ff5e4b0038054058ef7d49345d75102bf4da415",
   "text": "横たわる患者さんのそばで、真鍮の器から温かい黄色のハーブペーストをすくい上げる手",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ea1e9b1cb8cf37f8e36",
   "sourceHash": "4ea1e9b1cb8cf37f8e3692e299e1ebe88b77c10e0bdb5d592888dc04459577fd",
   "text": "では、バランスを取り戻し健康を促すことを目的とした、さまざまな伝統的アーユルヴェーダの施術をご提供しています：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following the linked name 'At Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2163d8e9761895a4bf21",
   "sourceHash": "2163d8e9761895a4bf21b6c18ec7e214eea0e4214b06f504bc53c347ff117de0",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Villageでは、バランスを取り戻し健康を促すことを目的とした、さまざまな伝統的アーユルヴェーダの施術をご提供しています：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_be1b15532a1796312da3",
   "sourceHash": "be1b15532a1796312da3acbe3e02e044ef9e836d5b2916aa0b7a8313fc362861",
   "text": "1. パンチャカルマ・デトックス療法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c29e33b389bb3e548be3",
   "sourceHash": "c29e33b389bb3e548be3585cb8eff4e8e3b22dc42027165f41c19cad2d46c222",
   "text": "2. アビヤンガ（アーユルヴェーダのオイルマッサージ）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_954940004a1018fa0253",
   "sourceHash": "954940004a1018fa0253de162a6ce44fa397601c58407c75a62e04aef5976250",
   "text": "ハーブオイルを用いた、心地よくリラックスできる全身マッサージで、血行を促し、緊張をほぐし、肌に潤いを与えます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf42b6e648da0e006d42",
   "sourceHash": "cf42b6e648da0e006d4246af2faf705225615ade6d5f1f5a4edfd2bf5d6b1ee0",
   "text": "3. シローダーラ（Shirodhara）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f62c97b086473d750d8e",
   "sourceHash": "f62c97b086473d750d8eaac2fd5690349c3fafe0c9a46dd343f6e1445771b181",
   "text": "温めたハーブオイルを額に繰り返し垂らすリラクゼーションの技法で、深いリラックスと思考の明晰さをもたらします。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e1298c7c29c4d5644855",
   "sourceHash": "e1298c7c29c4d56448555dad78ebc57e56c90f83f1b315e3fe84c5b3271c72bc",
   "text": "4. ニャヴァラキリ",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_239c1e4ddc05a6e006ba",
   "sourceHash": "239c1e4ddc05a6e006bacddb8e058786e41f2eef4f78e08dac698aa9b13d544e",
   "text": "温めた薬用米の包みでマッサージを行う若返りの療法で、筋肉の張りと筋力の向上に役立ちます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f781de4c88841d554331",
   "sourceHash": "f781de4c88841d55433154a8dc34a4d6c6dea95b5b6fecceb61f529bda8008d8",
   "text": "5. アーユルヴェーダの食事と生活習慣の指導",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba04964e928b41e8c3db",
   "sourceHash": "ba04964e928b41e8c3db4c78e1efcc88d08206c361e0b04d44a22faebc2bf47c",
   "text": "消化と全身の健康を高めるため、体質（ヴァータ、ピッタ、カパ）に応じた個別の食事アドバイスをご提供します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ad3c2c355f3571754a27",
   "sourceHash": "ad3c2c355f3571754a279bd71b31932ad66021a0764790187607ab0da078d01a",
   "text": "ケーララのアーユルヴェーダ療養施設としてKairaliが選ばれる理由",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat' rendered as 療養施設 (clinical register); unverifiable superlative 'The Best' omitted to avoid strengthening claims — owner may review."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_569b8bda57c00aa73912",
   "sourceHash": "569b8bda57c00aa739120d9e6bd5787d2e054b54b9345f086cb5e955d519c12f",
   "text": "伝統あるアーユルヴェーダの原理に基づき、本物の癒しの体験をご提供します。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
